# dsh-helloai-bak ignores
#
# NOTE: lib/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The repository ships the built
# artifacts so that `dsh plugin --profile <p> add github:hello-heyongping/dsh-helloai-bak`
# works without a build step. `npm run build` regenerates lib/ from src/.
node_modules/
*.tgz
.dsh-helloai-bak-build-*/
